    "updated_at": "2025-03-18T21:39:52Z",
    "body": "> It's worth noting that these can have directives similar to setup.cfg ... which starship would want to ignore, similar to how it does already for setup.cfg\n\n@FollowTheProcess what was the motivation for ignoring these? In my particular case, I am interested in starship displaying the version for the following `pyproject.toml`:\n\n```toml\n[project]\ndynamic = [\"version\"]\n\n[tool.hatch]\nversion.path = \"src/array_api_extra/__init__.py\"\n```",
